"During a community meeting, Lisa took the floor to discuss plans for a neighborhood cleanup. She encouraged residents to contribute their ideas and get involved. After receiving enthusiastic responses, she realized she had sparked interest in revitalizing the community. They set a date for the cleanup, creating a sense of unity and purpose among the neighbors.",1
