"Support Each Other's Dreams: Encourage and champion each other's aspirations, demonstrating mutual respect and admiration.",1
"Practice Active Listening: Pay attention to your partner's words and emotions, demonstrating genuine interest and empathy.",1
"Show Gratitude: Express appreciation for the little things your partner does, reinforcing positive behaviors and fostering a sense of value.",1
