"The potentially encroached land, located in areas with unclear land titles or disputed ownership, may offer lower prices but carry significant legal risks and development challenges.",1
"The plots with development restrictions, located in areas subject to environmental regulations or coastal zone restrictions, may offer lower prices but limit the scope of potential development.",1
